  <comment>Generate external identity provider brokering for Generic OIDC plus convention-only presets for Entra External ID, Entra ID, Google, Auth0, and Keycloak. Presets must never embed deployment tenant/client identifiers, secrets, authority URLs, or redirect hosts. Consume provider identifier, type, display name, authority URL, optional issuer, client identifier, encrypted client secret, requested Scopes, active state, priority, optional Tenant Resource, and Invite Only/Open SSO mode. Select active eligible providers by preferred-provider then priority. Support GET/query and POST/form_post callbacks with discovery, token exchange, signature, issuer, nonce, and required-claim validation. Enforce global issuer-subject uniqueness, prevent a callback from merging existing Users, retain records when providers become inactive, and create no SSO Session or Authorization Code on failure; emit a safe OIDC error redirect only after prior client redirect validation.</comment>
